msgstr "Cooldown de trick or treat reseteado a 5m."

#: trickortreat.py:1207
msgid "Trick or treating cooldown time set to the minimum of 30s."
msgstr "Cooldown de trick or treat establecido al mínimo de 30s."

#: trickortreat.py:1210
msgid "Trick or treating cooldown time set to {cooldown_time}s."
msgstr "Cooldown de trick or treat establecido en {cooldown_time}s."

#: trickortreat.py:1216
msgid "Set the cooldown time for the pickup command (default: 600s)."
msgstr "Fijar el tiempo de espera del comando pickup (por defecto: 600 s)."

#: trickortreat.py:1221
msgid "Pickup cooldown reset to 10m (600s)."
msgstr "Cooldown de pickup reseteado a 10m (600s)."

#: trickortreat.py:1224
msgid "Pickup cooldown set to {val}s."
msgstr "Cooldown de pickup establecido en {val}s."

#: trickortreat.py:1230
msgid "Set the cooldown time for the stealcandy command (default: 600s)."
msgstr ""
"Fijar el tiempo de espera del comando stealcandy (por defecto: 600 s)."

#: trickortreat.py:1235
msgid "Steal cooldown reset to 10m (600s)."
msgstr "Cooldown de steal reseteado a 10m (600s)."

#: trickortreat.py:1238
msgid "Steal cooldown set to {val}s."
msgstr "Cooldown de steal establecido en {val}s."

#: trickortreat.py:1244
msgid "Set how many hours a shield lasts (default: 4)."
msgstr "Fijar cuántas horas dura un escudo (por defecto: 4)."

#: trickortreat.py:1247
msgid "Shield duration reset to 4 hours."
msgstr "Duración del escudo reseteada a 4 horas."

#: trickortreat.py:1249
msgid "Shield duration set to {hours} hours."
msgstr "Duración del escudo establecida en {hours} horas."

#: trickortreat.py:1258
msgid "Pick up some candy, if there is any."
msgstr "Recoger caramelos del suelo, si hay."

#: trickortreat.py:1266
msgid "You need to wait {remaining}s before picking up candy again."
msgstr "Debes esperar {remaining}s antes de recoger caramelos de nuevo."

#: trickortreat.py:1274 trickortreat.py:1284
msgid "You start searching the area for candy..."
msgstr "Empiezas a buscar caramelos por la zona..."

#: trickortreat.py:1278
msgid "There's no candy left on the ground!"
msgstr "¡No quedan caramelos en el suelo!"

#: trickortreat.py:1288
msgid "You found {found} 🍬!"
msgstr "¡Encontraste {found} 🍬!"

#: trickortreat.py:1293
msgid "Steal some candy. Beware of shields!"
msgstr "Robar caramelos. ¡Cuidado con los escudos!"

#: trickortreat.py:1301
msgid "You need to wait {remaining}s before stealing again."
msgstr "Debes esperar {remaining}s antes de robar de nuevo."

#: trickortreat.py:1310
msgid "No one has any candy yet!"
msgstr "¡Nadie tiene caramelos todavía!"

#: trickortreat.py:1320
msgid "You couldn't find anyone to steal from."
msgstr "No pudiste encontrar a nadie a quien robar."

#: trickortreat.py:1328
msgid "🛡️ Shield Blocked!"
msgstr "🛡️ ¡Escudo Bloqueó!"

#: trickortreat.py:1329
msgid ""
"You tried to steal from **{name}**, but their candy bag\n"
"is protected by a **magical shield**! ✨\n"
"\n"
"Shield expires in: {remaining}"
msgstr ""
"Intentaste robar a **{name}**, pero su bolsa de caramelos\n"
"está protegida por un **escudo mágico**! ✨\n"
"\n"
"El escudo expira en: {remaining}"

#: trickortreat.py:1345 trickortreat.py:1385 trickortreat.py:1412
msgid "You snuck around for a while but didn't find anything."
msgstr "Merodeaste un rato pero no encontraste nada."

#: trickortreat.py:1354 trickortreat.py:1363
msgid "You see an unsuspecting guildmate..."
msgstr "Ves a un miembro del servidor desprevenido..."

#: trickortreat.py:1359
msgid ""
"There was nothing in {user1}'s pockets, so you picked {user2}'s pockets but "
"they had no candy either!"
msgstr ""
"No había nada en los bolsillos de {user1}, así que revisaste los de {user2},"
" ¡pero tampoco tenía caramelos!"

#: trickortreat.py:1368
msgid ""
"There was nothing in {user1}'s pockets, so you looked around again... you "
"saw {user2} in the distance, but you didn't think you could catch up..."
msgstr ""
"No había nada en los bolsillos de {user1}, así que miraste de nuevo... viste"
" a {user2} a lo lejos, pero no creíste poder alcanzarle..."

#: trickortreat.py:1372
msgid "You start sneaking around in the shadows..."
msgstr "Empiezas a acechar entre las sombras..."

#: trickortreat.py:1377
msgid ""
"You snuck up on {user} and tried picking their pockets but there was nothing"
" there!"
msgstr ""
"Te acercaste sigilosamente a {user} e intentaste robarle, ¡pero no había "
"nada!"

#: trickortreat.py:1381
msgid "You start looking around for a target..."
msgstr "Empiezas a buscar un objetivo..."

#: trickortreat.py:1394
msgid "You stealthily move over to an unsuspecting person..."
msgstr "Te acercas sigilosamente a una persona desprevenida..."

#: trickortreat.py:1398
msgid "You found someone to pickpocket, but they had nothing but pocket lint."
msgstr ""
"Encontraste a alguien a quien robar, pero solo tenía pelusa en los "
"bolsillos."

#: trickortreat.py:1402
msgid "You look around furtively..."
msgstr "Miras a tu alrededor furtivamente..."

#: trickortreat.py:1403
msgid "You glance around slowly, looking for your target..."
msgstr "Miras lentamente a tu alrededor, buscando tu objetivo..."

#: trickortreat.py:1404
msgid "You see someone with a full candy bag..."
msgstr "Ves a alguien con una bolsa llena de caramelos..."

#: trickortreat.py:1408
msgid "You creep closer to the target..."
msgstr "Te acercas sigilosamente al objetivo..."

#: trickortreat.py:1426
msgid "You hear a sound behind you! When you turn back, your target is gone."
msgstr ""
"¡Escuchas un sonido detrás de ti! Cuando te giras, tu objetivo ha "
"desaparecido."

#: trickortreat.py:1427
msgid "You look away for a moment and your target has vanished."
msgstr "Apartas la mirada un momento y tu objetivo ha desaparecido."

#: trickortreat.py:1428
msgid ""
"Something flashes in your peripheral vision, and as you turn to look, your "
"target gets away..."
msgstr ""
"Algo destella en tu visión periférica, y cuando te giras a mirar, tu "
"objetivo escapa..."

#: trickortreat.py:1452
msgid "There seems to be an unsuspecting victim in the corner..."
msgstr "Parece haber una víctima desprevenida en la esquina..."

#: trickortreat.py:1454
msgid "You stole {stolen} 🍬 from {user}!"
msgstr "¡Robaste {stolen} 🍬 de {user}!"

#: trickortreat.py:1459
msgid "🗡️ Candy Theft Alert!"
msgstr "🗡️ ¡Alerta de Robo de Caramelos!"

#: trickortreat.py:1460
msgid ""
"**{thief}** just stole **{stolen}** 🍬 from your bag!\n"
"\n"
"Remaining candies: **{remaining}** 🍬\n"
"\n"
"*Buy a 🛡️ Shield from the shop to protect yourself!*"
msgstr ""
"**{thief}** acaba de robar **{stolen}** 🍬 de tu bolsa!\n"
"\n"
"Caramelos restantes: **{remaining}** 🍬\n"
"\n"
"*¡Compra un 🛡️ Escudo en la tienda para protegerte!*"

#: trickortreat.py:1478
msgid "View or manage guild-wide trick-or-treat events!"
msgstr "¡Ver o gestionar eventos de truco o trato de todo el servidor!"

#: trickortreat.py:1481
msgid "❌ No active event right now."
msgstr "❌ Ahora mismo no hay ningún evento activo."

#: trickortreat.py:1496
msgid "🎃 Guild Event — {desc}"
msgstr "🎃 Evento del Servidor — {desc}"

#: trickortreat.py:1497
msgid ""
"**Goal:** {get} {title} **{value}** candies!\n"
"\n"
"**Progress:**\n"
"{bar} **{value2}**/{value} ({pct}%)\n"
"\n"
"**Reward:** {value3} 🍬 per participant\n"
"\n"
"{value4}"
msgstr ""
"**Objetivo:** {get} {title} ¡**{value}** caramelos!\n"
"\n"
"**Progreso:**\n"
"{bar} **{value2}**/{value} ({pct}%)\n"
"\n"
"**Premio:** {value3} 🍬 por participante\n"
"\n"
"{value4}"

#: trickortreat.py:1500
msgid "🎉 *Almost there! Keep going!*"
msgstr "🎉 *¡Casi lo tenéis! ¡Seguid así!*"

#: trickortreat.py:1500
msgid "💪 *Keep going!*"
msgstr "💪 *¡Seguid así!*"

#: trickortreat.py:1508
msgid ""
"Start a guild event!\n"
"\n"
"        Types: eat, collect, steal\n"
"        Example: [p]totevent start eat 5000 100\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"¡Empezar un evento del servidor!\n"
"\n"
"        Tipos: eat, collect, steal\n"
"        Ejemplo: [p]totevent start eat 5000 100\n"
"        "

#: trickortreat.py:1515
msgid "Invalid event type! Choose from: {types}"
msgstr "¡Tipo de evento inválido! Elige entre: {types}"

#: trickortreat.py:1517 trickortreat.py:1589
msgid "Goal must be positive!"
msgstr "¡La meta debe ser positiva!"

#: trickortreat.py:1519 trickortreat.py:1571
msgid "Reward must be positive!"
msgstr "¡La recompensa debe ser positiva!"

#: trickortreat.py:1521
msgid ""
"An event is already active! Use `{prefix}totevent stop` to cancel it first."
msgstr ""
"¡Ya hay un evento activo! Usa `{prefix}totevent stop` para cancelarlo "
"primero."

#: trickortreat.py:1531
msgid "🎃 New Guild Event Started!"
msgstr "🎃 ¡Nuevo Evento del Servidor!"

#: trickortreat.py:1532
msgid ""
"**{desc}**\n"
"\n"
"{emoji} Goal: **{goal}** candies {event_type}!\n"
"🍬 Reward: **{reward}** candies per participant!\n"
"\n"
"*Everyone's progress counts! Work together!* 🎃"
msgstr ""
"**{desc}**\n"
"\n"
"{emoji} Meta: **{goal}** caramelos {event_type}!\n"
"🍬 Recompensa: **{reward}** caramelos por participante!\n"
"\n"
"*¡El progreso de todos cuenta! ¡Trabajen juntos!* 🎃"

#: trickortreat.py:1546
msgid "Check the current event progress."
msgstr "Ver el progreso del evento actual."

#: trickortreat.py:1548 trickortreat.py:1569 trickortreat.py:1587
msgid "No active event right now."
msgstr "No hay evento activo ahora mismo."

#: trickortreat.py:1554
msgid "Stop the current guild event."
msgstr "Detener el evento actual del servidor."

#: trickortreat.py:1556
msgid "No active event to stop."
msgstr "No hay evento activo que detener."

#: trickortreat.py:1558
msgid "🎃 Event Cancelled"
msgstr "🎃 Evento Cancelado"

#: trickortreat.py:1558
msgid "The guild event has been cancelled."
msgstr "El evento del servidor ha sido cancelado."

#: trickortreat.py:1564
msgid ""
"Change the reward for the current event.\n"
"\n"
"        Example: [p]totevent reward 200\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Cambiar el premio del evento actual.\n"
"\n"
"        Ejemplo: [p]totevent reward 200\n"
"        "

#: trickortreat.py:1574
msgid "✅ Event reward updated to **{reward}** 🍬 per participant!"
msgstr "✅ ¡Premio del evento actualizado a **{reward}** 🍬 por participante!"

#: trickortreat.py:1582
msgid ""
"Change the goal for the current event.\n"
"\n"
"        Example: [p]totevent goal 10000\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Cambiar el objetivo del evento actual.\n"
"\n"
"        Ejemplo: [p]totevent goal 10000\n"
"        "

#: trickortreat.py:1593
msgid "Goal must be higher than current progress ({progress})!"
msgstr "¡El objetivo debe ser mayor que el progreso actual ({progress})!"

#: trickortreat.py:1599
msgid "✅ Event goal updated to **{goal}**!"
msgstr "✅ ¡Objetivo del evento actualizado a **{goal}**!"

#: trickortreat.py:1610
msgid "Channel management for Trick or Treat."
msgstr "Gestión de canales de Truco o trato."

#: trickortreat.py:1614
msgid "Trick or Treat Channels:\n"
msgstr "Canales de Trick or Treat:\n"

#: trickortreat.py:1624
